      ],
      "body_text": [
       {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We design experiences in an intuitive and natural way, and we communicate clearly, in an easy-to-approach, human-to-human way, even when dealing with complex and intangible phenomena and ideas. Our imagery is honest and authentic, without falling into a generic trap. It is high quality with a point of view, rather than a generic documentary style.",
